            <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-32 h-32 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-12 -left-12 w-32 h-32 bg-rose-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
            
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-teal-300 neon-cyan mb-2 tracking-wider">ЭХО В ТЕМНОТЕ 3D // LIDAR</h1>
            <p class="text-xs text-teal-200/80 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Бесконечная энергия. Чудовища светятся багровым светом повсюду. Радар показывает только маяки и стены.</p>
            
            <div class="text-left bg-black/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-teal-500/20 mb-6 space-y-2 text-[11px] text-teal-100/90">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>ЛЕВ. ПАЛЕЦ:</span><span class="text-teal-300 font-bold">Джойстик (сильнее = бег)</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>ПРАВ. ЭКРАН:</span><span class="text-teal-300 font-bold">Свободный обзор свайпом</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>КН. LIDAR:</span><span class="text-teal-300 font-bold">Лазерный конус (удерж.)</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>КН. СОНАР 360°:</span><span class="text-teal-300 font-bold">Импульс волны</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>КН. SCANN (R):</span><span class="text-teal-300 font-bold">Инфракрасный плавный скан</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>КН. PULSE (F):</span><span class="text-teal-300 font-bold">Квантовый взрыв карты</span></div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6 px-2">
                <span class="text-xs text-teal-300 font-bold">Чувствительность:</span>
                <input id="sensSlider" type="range" min="0.3" max="3.0" step="0.1" value="1.1" class="w-40 accent-teal-400 bg-black/60 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                <span id="sensValue" class="text-xs text-teal-300 font-bold w-8 text-right">1.1</span>
            </div>

            <button id="btnStart" class="w-full py-4 bg-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-400 text-black font-extrabold text-sm rounded-xl tracking-widest shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(0,245,212,0.5)] active:scale-95 transition-all">
                ЗАПУСТИТЬ СКАНЕР (FULLSCREEN)
