                <button id="btnHudClear" class="pointer-events-auto px-2.5 py-1 bg-rose-500/20 hover:bg-rose-500/40 border border-rose-500/40 rounded text-[9px] font-bold text-rose-300 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow">
                    СБРОС ТОЧЕК [C]
